## Row-keyed current evidence

All local evidence rows are initially open. Before consumption, inherited
theorem evidence requires exact protected Git-blob identity, complete checked
field types and the actual object/guard chains. Reports alone are not proofs.
For each field, P is its frozen full proposition; the certificate campaign
changes the producer to Q=True or deletes its field/initializer while the
generic and canonical expected-type consumers remain P. The three same-object
producer/consumer stages and exact diagnostic must all execute successfully
in their prescribed roles before a mutation is credited.

Runtime classifier P requires bounded exit1 and a sole exact expected diagnostic
across stdout/stderr, with no other nonempty line. Its production check must
implement P itself. Real stream/exit/resource fixtures challenge P; an expected
substring amid other diagnostics is not P. Profile P requires the independently
anchored full source/toolchain/dependency/artifact identity. Tampering checks
must challenge this same P, never substitute mere timestamp freshness.

No coordinator acceptance or completed local replay is asserted by this freeze.
